// The CodeJock grid's helper classes and constants under the names DataFlex 23 and later give them, for the
// DataFlex versions before 23. There they carry "Report" in their names: cCJReportItemButton,
// xtpReportItemControlLeft and so on. A package that needs one of them Uses this package and writes the
// new name. From DataFlex 23 on this package adds nothing.
Use cCJGrid.pkg

#IF (!@ < 230)

Define xtpGridItemControlUnknown      for xtpReportItemControlUnknown
Define xtpGridItemControlLeft         for xtpReportItemControlLeft
Define xtpGridItemControlRight        for xtpReportItemControlRight
Define xtpGridItemControlTypeButton   for xtpReportItemControlTypeButton
Define xtpGridItemButtonStateAll      for xtpReportItemButtonStateAll
Define xtpGridItemButtonStateNormal   for xtpReportItemButtonStateNormal
Define xtpGridItemButtonStateHot      for xtpReportItemButtonStateHot
Define xtpGridItemButtonStatePressed  for xtpReportItemButtonStatePressed
Define xtpGridItemButtonStateDisabled for xtpReportItemButtonStateDisabled
Define xtpGridTextDecorationUnderline for xtpReportTextDecorationUnderline

Class cCJGridItemButton is a cCJReportItemButton
End_Class

Class cCJGridItemControls is a cCJReportItemControls
End_Class

Class cCJGridHitTestInfo is a cCJReportHitTestInfo
End_Class

Class cCJGridHyperlinks is a cCJReportHyperlinks
End_Class

Class cCJGridHyperlinkStyle is a cCJReportHyperlinkStyle
End_Class

#ENDIF
